Sure, event_time is a CSIM variable that stores the time of the last event processed by the current process. It is used to calculate the delay between the current time and the time of the last event.

Here is the modified code with comments explaining major steps:

#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <csim.h>

