    ```
    hadoop jar path/to/your.jar /path/to/Porto_taxi_trajectories.csv /output/path
    ```

Replace `/path/to/your.jar`, `/path/to/Porto_taxi_trajectories.csv`, and `/output/path` with appropriate paths for the dataset and output.

