2. Name it "OutageCalendarPane".
3. Open the "OutageCalendarPane" in the form designer and add the required controls:

- 2 DateTimePicker controls (startDateTimePicker and endDateTimePicker) for start and end date and time
- 2 TextBox controls (eventNameTextBox and eventNoteTextBox) for the event name and note
- 1 RichTextBox control (emailContentTextBox) for the email text
- 1 Button control (submitBtn) for submitting the event
- 1 Button control (cancelBtn) for canceling the event

