- Go to "Certificates & secrets" > "New client secret."
- Provide a description, choose an expiration period, and click on "Add."
- Copy the "Value" of the client secret after it's generated.

2. Set up the Microsoft.Identity.Client package and code:
- Install the Microsoft.Identity.Client NuGet package in your Visual Studio project.
