    -fx-background-color: #3f51b5;
    -fx-text-fill: white;
    -fx-start-margin: -1;
    -fx-end-margin: -1;
}
```

You can move the styling part to a separate CSS file or just add it to the default one according to your project structure. Remember to load the CSS file in your JavaFX application.

