1. It requires the Microsoft Access Database Engine ACE OLE DB 12.0 provider (`Microsoft.ACE.OLEDB.12.0`) to be installed on the system. If the ACE provider is not installed, you may encounter the error "The 'Microsoft.ACE.OLEDB.12.0' provider is not registered on the local machine". You can download the ACE OLE DB provider from https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/details.aspx?id=13255.

2. This solution may not work in .NET Core or .NET 5+ as mentioned earlier. You may need to use .NET Framework (4.x or older) for your project in order to use this solution.

