2. Install Astro CLI (Command Line Interface) globally on your computer by running the following command in your terminal:

```bash
npm install -g astro
```

3. Create a new Astro project using the following command:

```bash
astro create my-linktree-clone
```

4. Select the "Starter Kit (Generic)" template when prompted.

5. Change to the newly created directory:

