```
7. Create two files named 'styles.css' and 'systemjs.config.js' inside the 'src' folder.

Step 2: TypeScript Logic
------------------------
1. Create a TypeScript file called 'app.ts' inside the 'src' folder and add the following code:
```typescript
interface Book {
  title: string;
  author: string;
  publishDate: string;
}

