    sharedPreferences.edit().putString("favorites", gson.toJson(_favorites.value)).apply()
}
```

5. Lastly, modifications are made to the `addFavoriteSong()` and `removeFavoriteSong()` functions to call `loadFavorites()` and, in turn, save updated lists to the local storage:

```kotlin
