Great! With Dagger Hilt, you can use `@ViewModelScoped` annotation to give your ViewModel a longer lifespan that is tied to the lifecycle of your app's ViewModelStoreOwner. Here's how you can make use of it:

1. Annotate your ViewModel class with `@HiltViewModel` and `@ViewModelScoped`, like this:

```kotlin
@HiltViewModel
@ViewModelScoped
class EmulatorViewModel @Inject constructor(
    private val emulatorUseCases: EmulatorUseCases
) : ViewModel() {
    private val _state = MutableStateFlow(EmulatorState())
    val state = _state
    // ...
}
```

2. In your Composable, use `rememberViewModel()` to retrieve the ViewModel instance:

```kotlin
val viewModel: EmulatorViewModel = rememberViewModel()
```

3. Use the same instance of `NavBackStackEntry` used when navigating between the two screens to restore the state of the Composable:

```kotlin
val navBackStackEntry by navController.currentBackStackEntryAsState()
val restored = rememberSavedInstanceState(navBackStackEntry)

EmulatorScreen(
    navController = navController,
    viewModel = viewModel,
    paddingValues = paddingValues,
    restoredState = restored
)
```

By using `@ViewModelScoped`, your ViewModel instance will be shared across Composables and will be retained during configuration changes and across navigation. This will ensure that the state of your ViewModel is not lost when navigating from one screen to another.

I apologize for the confusion earlier. You're correct that `@ViewModelScoped` is not needed with `@HiltViewModel`.

When using `@HiltViewModel`, you should remove the `@ViewModelScoped` annotation from your ViewModel class. This is because `@HiltViewModel` already provides the necessary scoping for your ViewModel.

Here's an example ViewModel class annotated with just `@HiltViewModel`:

```kotlin
@HiltViewModel
class MyViewModel @Inject constructor(
    private val myRepository: MyRepository
) : ViewModel() {
    // ...
}
```

Make sure that you have the `androidx.hilt:hilt-lifecycle-viewmodel` dependency added to your app's Gradle file (`build.gradle`). This is required in order to use `@HiltViewModel`.

Once you have made these changes, try rebuilding your project to ensure that the App Injector generates the necessary classes for your ViewModel.

要在 ArcGIS Pro SDK 中保存编辑，您需要使用 EditOperation 类和 EditOperation.Callback 接口。

以下是保存编辑的基本步骤：

1. 创建一个新的 EditOperation 对象，并使用 Begin() 方法开始一个新的操作。

```csharp
EditOperation editOperation = new EditOperation();
editOperation.Name = "Update feature";
editOperation.SelectModifiedFeatures = true;
editOperation.Begin(myMapView.Map,"FeatureLayer");
```

2. 执行所需的编辑操作，例如更改要素属性或位置。

```csharp
// 创建一个新的点
MapPoint newPoint = new MapPoint(-122.45, 37.75, SpatialReferences.WGS84);

// 获取编辑工具
SketchCreationMode creationMode = SketchCreationMode.Point;
var editTool = MyMapView.Editor.GetActiveTool(creationMode) as SketchTool;

// 创建并添加图形
var graphic = new Graphic(newPoint, editTool.Symbol);
MyMapView.GraphicsOverlays[0].Graphics.Add(graphic);
```

3. 在 EditOperation 对象上调用 Next() 方法，以便在操作完成时通知编辑器。

```csharp
editOperation.Next(addGraphicComplete);
```

4. 创建一个 EditOperation.Callback 接口实现，以在操作完成时执行任何必要的清理任务。

```csharp
private void addGraphicComplete(EditOperation editOperation)
{
  // 执行任何必要的清理操作
  MyMapView.Editor.CancelActiveTool();

  // 结束编辑操作
  editOperation.Complete();
}
```

5. 在实现 EditOperation.Callback 接口的类上，注册 EditOperation.Callback 实例。

```csharp
// 在构造函数中注册编辑操作回调
public MyEditOperation()
{
  EditOperation.Callback addGraphicComplete = new EditOperation.Callback(addGraphicComplete);
  EditOperation.Callback beginOperation = new EditOperation.Callback(beginOperation);
  _editOperation = new EditOperation();
  _editOperation.Callbacks.Add(addGraphicComplete);
  _editOperation.Callbacks.Add(beginOperation);
  _editOperation.Name = "Add to Graphics Overlay";
}
```

6. 最后，调用 EditOperation 的 Execute() 方法来应用编辑操作。

```csharp
// 执行编辑操作
if (_editOperation.IsActive)
  _editOperation.Execute();
```

以上是保存编辑的基本步骤，具体实现可能因数据类型和编辑需求而异。请注意，在执行 EditOperation.Execute() 方法时，系统将提示您保存编辑，以确保更改得到保留。

要在 ArcGIS Pro SDK 3.0 中修改图层字段的值，请使用以下代码：

```C#
//获取您要修改的要素集和编辑器
var featureLayer = map.GetLayersAsFlattenedList().OfType<FeatureLayer>().FirstOrDefault(); //替换成您想要修改的要素图层
var editOperation = new EditOperation();
editOperation.Callback(context => { });

// 开始编辑操作
editOperation.Name = $"修改字段值：{featureLayer.Name}";
editOperation.SelectModifiedFeatures = true; //选择被修改的要素
editOperation.Begin(featureLayer);

// 更新要素的属性值
var queryFilter = new QueryFilter { WhereClause = "1=1" }; //查询过滤器，这里设置为更新所有要素
var update = featureLayer.CreateUpdate();
update.WhereClause = queryFilter.WhereClause;
var featureCursor = update.GetCursor();
while (featureCursor.MoveNext())
{
    var feature = featureCursor.Current as Feature;
    // 获取或设置字段值
    var attribute = feature.GetAttributeValue("FIELD_NAME"); //替换成您需要修改的字段名
    // 修改字段值
    //...
    feature.SetAttributeValue("FIELD_NAME", "NEW_VALUE"); //替换成您需要修改的新值
    //...
    feature.Store();
}

//保存编辑
editOperation.ExecuteAsync();
```

请注意，“1=1”表示查询所有要素。在实际情况中，您可以根据自己的需求使用任何其他查询过滤器。

如果要更新多个字段的值，请添加相应的 SetAttributeValue 调用，以便在遍历要素时修改每个字段的值。

执行更新后，调用 ExecuteAsync() 方法来提交更改并保存要素的更新。

